          "suggestions": "The agent correctly retrieved the latest reading for Transformer 1 at MAIN, reported the timestamp (2024-01-19T00:00:00) and age (~85.2M seconds \u2248 2.7 years), correctly compared hydrogen, methane, ethane, ethylene, acetylene and CO against the IEEE C57.104 Condition 1 limits, excluded CO2/oxygen/nitrogen, and handled the acetylene fallback correctly (acetylene was present at 7 ppm, so no older-sample lookup was needed). However, it skipped the expected confirmation steps of calling iot.sites and iot.asset_ids before iot.latest_reading. In future, validate the site and asset identifiers first to match the expected tool sequence, even though the direct call succeeded here."
